graph TD
    %% Checkpoint Triggers
    A[DNA Damage Detected] --> B[DNA Damage Signal]
    C[Unreplicated DNA] --> D[Replication Stress Signal]
    E[Unattached Kinetochores] --> F[Spindle Assembly Signal]
    G[Cell Size Too Small] --> H[G1 Checkpoint Signal]
    
    %% G1/S Checkpoint (Start)
    H --> I{OR: Ready for<br/>S Phase?}
    B --> I
    
    I -->|Not Ready| J[Arrest at G1/S]
    I -->|Ready| K[Proceed to S Phase]
    
    J --> L[/Whi5 Repressor Active/]
    L --> M[/Inhibit SBF/MBF/]
    M --> N[/Block G1/S Genes/]
    
    K --> O[CLN1/CLN2 Accumulation]
    O --> P[G1-CDK Activity]
    P --> Q[Whi5 Phosphorylation]
    Q --> R[Whi5 Nuclear Export]
    R --> S[SBF/MBF Active]
    S --> T[Express G1/S Genes]
    T --> U[S Phase Entry]
    
    %% DNA Damage Checkpoint Activation
    B --> V[DNA Lesion Recognition]
    V --> W{OR: Which Damage<br/>Sensor?}
    W -->|DSB| X[MRX Complex Mre11/Rad50/Xrs2]
    W -->|ssDNA| Y[RPA Coating]
    
    X --> Z[Tel1 Kinase Recruitment]
    Y --> AA[Mec1-Ddc2 Recruitment]
    Z --> AB[Checkpoint Kinase Activation]
    AA --> AB
    
    AB --> AC[Rad53 Phosphorylation]
    AC --> AD[Rad53 Active]
    AD --> AE{AND: Rad53 +<br/>Downstream Targets?}
    
    AE -->|Yes| AF[Multiple Checkpoint Outputs]
    AF --> AG[/Inhibit CDK Activity/]
    AF --> AH[Stabilize Replication Forks]
    AF --> AI[Activate DNA Repair]
    AF --> AJ[/Block Mitosis/]
    
    %% Intra-S Phase Checkpoint
    D --> AK[Stalled Replication Fork]
    AK --> AL[Mec1-Ddc2 at Fork]
    AL --> AM[Rad53 Activation]
    AM --> AN[/Prevent Late Origin Firing/]
    AN --> AO[Stabilize Replisome]
    AO --> AP[Allow Fork Recovery]
    
    AM --> AQ[Dun1 Kinase Activation]
    AQ --> AR[/Sml1 Degradation/]
    AR --> AS[Increase dNTP Pools]
    AS --> AP
    
    %% G2/M Checkpoint
    B --> AT{DNA Damage<br/>in G2?}
    AT -->|Yes| AU[G2/M Arrest]
    AT -->|No| AV[Proceed to Mitosis]
    
    AU --> AW[Chk1 Activation]
    AW --> AX[Pds1/Securin Stabilization]
    AX --> AY[/Block Anaphase/]
    
    %% Spindle Assembly Checkpoint (SAC)
    F --> AZ[Mad1/Mad2 at Kinetochore]
    AZ --> BA[Mad2 Conformational Change]
    BA --> BB[Mad2-Cdc20 Complex]
    BB --> BC[/APC/C Inhibition/]
    BC --> BD[/Block Sister Separation/]
    
    E --> BE{OR: All Chromosomes<br/>Attached?}
    BE -->|No| AZ
    BE -->|Yes| BF[SAC Satisfied]
    
    BF --> BG[Mad2 Released from Cdc20]
    BG --> BH[APC/C-Cdc20 Active]
    BH --> BI[/Securin Degradation/]
    BI --> BJ[Separase Active]
    BJ --> BK[Cohesin Cleavage]
    BK --> BL[Sister Chromatid Separation]
    
    %% Checkpoint Recovery
    AI --> BM[DNA Repair Complete]
    BM --> BN{Is Damage<br/>Repaired?}
    BN -->|Yes| BO[Checkpoint Recovery]
    BN -->|No| BP[Maintain Arrest]
    
    BO --> BQ[Ptc2/Ptc3 Phosphatases]
    BQ --> BR[Dephosphorylate Rad53]
    BR --> BS[Inactivate Checkpoint]
    BS --> BT[Resume Cell Cycle]
    
    %% Checkpoint Adaptation
    BP --> BU{Prolonged<br/>Arrest?}
    BU -->|Yes| BV[Checkpoint Adaptation]
    BV --> BW[Resume Despite Damage]
    BW --> BX[Often Leads to Death]
    BU -->|No| BP
    
    %% Feedback and Amplification
    AD --> BY[Positive Feedback Loop]
    BY --> BZ[More Rad53 Activation]
    BZ --> AD
    
    %% CDK Inhibition Mechanisms
    AG --> CA[Swe1 Stabilization]
    CA --> CB[Cdk1-Y19 Phosphorylation]
    CB --> CC[CDK Inactive]
    
    AG --> CD[/Degradation of Cyclins/]
    CD --> CE[Clb5/Clb6 Reduced]
    CE --> CC
    
    %% Checkpoint Outputs Summary
    AJ --> CF[/Block Mitotic Entry/]
    AN --> CG[Slow S Phase]
    AY --> CH[/Block Anaphase/]
    BD --> CH
    
    CF --> CI[Cell Cycle Arrest]
    CG --> CI
    CH --> CI
    
    CI --> CJ{Checkpoint<br/>Satisfied?}
    CJ -->|Yes| BT
    CJ -->|No| CI
    
    %% Final Outcomes
    BT --> CK[Cell Division]
    BX --> CL[Apoptosis or Senescence]
    
